              "help": {
                "text": "CWE: CWE-22\n\nOWASP: A01:2021 - Broken Access Control\n\nMITRE: T1083\n\nPCI DSS: Req 6.2.1 - Protect all system components\n\nNIST: AC-3 Access Enforcement\n\nISO 27001: A.9.4.1 Information Access Restriction\n\nSOC2: CC6.1 Logical and Physical Access Controls\n\nTaint path: request.GET.get('path') -> p -> open\n\nRemediation:\n- Canonicalize file paths using os.path.realpath() before use.\n- Validate that resolved paths reside within an allowed base directory.\n- Avoid user-controlled input in file system paths entirely.\n- Implement strict access controls on sensitive directories.",
